WEBVTT

00:11:28.556 --> 00:11:30.996
she didn't let that dictate her happiness.

00:11:31.036 --> 00:11:33.076
She didn't put all her eggs in that basket

00:11:33.076 --> 00:11:34.436
and shut up shop.

00:11:34.996 --> 00:11:37.676
But the second realization
hit me a lot harder.

00:11:38.796 --> 00:11:41.676
Despite everything,
Trudy was happier than me.

00:11:43.956 --> 00:11:48.396
Here's where we get to take
our happiness into our own hands.

00:11:49.876 --> 00:11:51.036
What I want you to do

00:11:51.076 --> 00:11:53.956
is to think about the areas
where you would score zero

00:11:53.996 --> 00:11:55.156
or minus one

00:11:55.196 --> 00:11:57.316
and commit to doing something to improve.

00:11:57.356 --> 00:11:58.916
So whatever you commit to do,

00:11:58.916 --> 00:12:02.356
I want you to give it a red hot go
in the next summer.